## MedSync Core ROI

### Labor Efficiency

| Metric | Benchmark | Source |
|--------|-----------|--------|
| Care coordinator time on admin | 60% current | Industry research |
| Admin time reduction | 40% | Customer average |
| Hours saved/coordinator/week | 16 hours | Customer data |
| Fully loaded cost/hour | $45 | BLS + benefits |

**Calculation**:
```
Annual Savings = Coordinators × 16 hrs × 52 weeks × $45 × 40%
```

**Example (10 coordinators)**:
```
= 10 × 16 × 52 × $45 × 0.40 = $149,760/year
```

### Care Plan Efficiency

