## MedSync Connect ROI

### Referral Leakage Reduction

| Metric | Benchmark | Source |
|--------|-----------|--------|
| Referral leakage (baseline) | 35-50% | Industry |
| Leakage reduction | 50% relative | Customer avg |
| Revenue per referral | $350 | Customer data |
| Margin on retained referral | 25% | Assumption |

**Calculation**:
```
Retained Revenue = Monthly Referrals × Leakage Rate × Reduction × Revenue × Margin × 12
```

**Example (5,000 referrals/month, 40% leakage)**:
```
= 5,000 × 0.40 × 0.50 × $350 × 0.25 × 12 = $1,050,000/year
```

### Referral Efficiency

| Metric | Before | After | Savings |
|--------|--------|-------|---------|
| Time per referral | 45 min | 15 min | 67% |
| Referrals/staff/day | 8 | 24 | 3x |
| Staff required | 5 FTEs | 2 FTEs | 3 FTEs |

