## MedSync Analytics ROI

### Risk Stratification Value

| Metric | Benchmark |
|--------|-----------|
| High-risk patients identified | +15% |
| Intervention success rate | +25% |
| Cost per high-risk patient | $25,000/year |
| Cost reduction from intervention | 15% |

**Calculation**:
```
Savings = High-Risk Patients × Additional Identified × Cost × Reduction Rate
```

**Example (10,000 high-risk patients)**:
```
= 10,000 × 0.15 × $25,000 × 0.15 = $5,625,000/year
```

