## Assumptions & Caveats

### Standard Assumptions

| Assumption | Value | Adjustable |
|------------|-------|------------|
| Fully loaded labor cost | $45/hour | Yes |
| Coordinator admin time | 60% | Yes |
| Referral margin | 25% | Yes |
| Implementation ramp | 3 months | — |

### Conservative vs. Optimistic

| Scenario | Multiplier |
|----------|------------|
| Conservative | 0.7x |
| Base Case | 1.0x |
| Optimistic | 1.3x |

### Disclaimers

- Results based on customer averages
- Individual results may vary
- Requires successful adoption
- Excludes soft benefits
- Three-year analysis recommended

